{
 "type": "root",
 "children": [
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "A node is a server that runs the ownsolid agent. The "
    },
    {
     "type": "link",
     "url": "/nodes",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Nodes"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " page lists every node with its\nstate and lets you add, change and remove them."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "depth": 2,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Adding a node"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "id": "adding-a-node"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "ordered": true,
   "start": 1,
   "spread": false,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Choose "
        },
        {
         "type": "strong",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "value": "Add node"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": ". The page creates a one-time join token and shows the commands to run on the\nnew server."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Run the commands as shown. They keep the token out of the shell's history."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "The node appears in the list once its agent joins. A token joins one node; an unused token can be\nrevoked."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Choose what the node will do when you add it: "
    },
    {
     "type": "strong",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Report its facts"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": ", or "
    },
    {
     "type": "strong",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Serve models"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " for a GPU host\nthat will take "
    },
    {
     "type": "link",
     "url": "help:model-services",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "deployments"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": ". This is fixed when the node joins."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "A node joins only while the installation has a valid "
    },
    {
     "type": "link",
     "url": "help:license",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "license"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "depth": 2,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "States"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "id": "states"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "align": [
    null,
    null
   ],
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "tableRow",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "tableCell",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "State"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "tableCell",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Meaning"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "tableRow",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "tableCell",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Online"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "tableCell",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "The agent reported recently."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "tableRow",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "tableCell",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Not responding"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "tableCell",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "The agent has not reported for a while, but not long enough to call the node offline."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "tableRow",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "tableCell",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Offline"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "tableCell",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "The agent stopped reporting. Check that the server is up and can reach the control plane."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "tableRow",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "tableCell",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Disabled"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "tableCell",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "An administrator took the node out of service. No new work goes to it."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "The tiles above the list count each state and filter the list when chosen."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "depth": 2,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Changing a node"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "id": "changing-a-node"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Open a node from the list to see its system facts and recent tasks."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "ordered": false,
   "spread": false,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "strong",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "value": "Collect facts"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": " asks the agent to report the server's hardware and software again."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "strong",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "value": "Rename"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": " and "
        },
        {
         "type": "strong",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "value": "Disable"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": " can be undone from the notice that follows."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "strong",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "value": "Remove"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": " asks you to type the node's name, because it cannot be undone."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Select several nodes in the list to act on them together."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "depth": 2,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Agent pacing"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "id": "agent-pacing"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "link",
     "url": "/nodes/pacing",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Agent pacing"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " sets how often agents report and how they back off after losing the\nconnection. Agents adopt a change from their next report."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "depth": 2,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Refusing agent traffic"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "id": "refusing-agent-traffic"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "When the fleet itself is overloading the installation, the same page can refuse agents' calls, lowest\npriority first: transfers, then telemetry, then everything except quarantine reports. A change acts at\nonce, needs a reason and is kept in the audit trail, and agents retry later by themselves."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "With everything refused, nodes turn offline here and receive no new work, while tasks and model\nservices already running on them continue. The page asks you to type "
    },
    {
     "type": "inlineCode",
     "value": "heartbeats"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " first, and the\nNodes page says so for as long as it lasts."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "If this page cannot be reached, run "
    },
    {
     "type": "inlineCode",
     "value": "ownsolid-install agents shed"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " on the server."
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
